My intention was not to participate in a fight again and despite that, I went to the battlefield again and honestly, I felt motivated, if you want to qualify me as a demon for that, I will not tell you no.

00:46:46.230 --> 00:46:50.070
I'm sorry, Amu.

00:46:50.070 --> 00:47:00.000
I just understood, even if it's a little, the reasons why the one who built you, did not make a simple machine, people are not

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:04.090
We are not gods or demons. We have both sides in us.

00:47:04.090 --> 00:47:09.000
You can only trust such a huge power to a being with feelings like you.

00:47:09.000 --> 00:47:16.610
That's what she thought. In this sense, I think you and I are practically the same.

00:47:16.610 --> 00:47:25.570
If I hadn't become a researcher and had continued to pilot Mazinger,

00:47:25.570 --> 00:47:29.090
surely the one who would be there would not be Tetsuya, but me.

00:47:30.410 --> 00:47:33.330
For this reason, I must face the situation.

00:47:33.330 --> 00:47:36.340
Don't say that! Humanity has no way of winning!

00:47:36.340 --> 00:47:39.340
We will recover the Infinity with another Mazinger.

00:47:39.340 --> 00:47:43.400
If there is no one left...

00:47:43.400 --> 00:47:48.750
Yes, there is still a demonic god.

00:47:48.750 --> 00:47:55.160
One.

00:47:55.160 --> 00:47:58.250
Hello.

00:47:58.250 --> 00:48:00.000
Going to the bottom, guys.

00:48:00.030 --> 00:48:02.030
Ah, yes? Very good, thank you very much.

00:48:02.030 --> 00:48:04.290
Are you making reforms?

00:48:04.290 --> 00:48:06.570
Yes, more or less, something like that.

00:48:06.570 --> 00:48:07.400
Hello.

00:48:07.400 --> 00:48:13.250
I'll open it right away. Come on.

00:48:13.250 --> 00:48:20.900
Come on, come on, come on, keep packing.

00:48:20.900 --> 00:48:23.330
I'm going to have to leave soon.

00:48:23.330 --> 00:48:27.340
All these pieces are very valuable and it took me a lot to gather them.

00:48:27.340 --> 00:48:29.700
As if you fell, you will find out.

00:48:30.670 --> 00:48:41.920
*Heavy breathing*

00:48:41.920 --> 00:48:52.220
