00:49:00.160 --> 00:49:03.160
A super-alleation layer generator.

00:49:03.160 --> 00:49:05.160
Professor Nosori! Professor Sewashi!

00:49:05.160 --> 00:49:06.160
Hello!

00:49:06.160 --> 00:49:08.870
Oh yeah? What does that represent?

00:49:08.870 --> 00:49:14.180
Let's see... In short, we could say that it is...

00:49:14.180 --> 00:49:15.180
Look at what he's doing.

00:49:15.180 --> 00:49:20.070
It's a kind of huge 3D printer that works with photonic energy.

00:49:20.070 --> 00:49:25.070
Look, with this it's possible to obtain any type of installation or weapon.

00:49:25.070 --> 00:49:25.930
It's incredible!

00:49:25.930 --> 00:49:28.940
We were already bored of so much decent research.

00:49:28.940 --> 00:49:30.000
Finally, we can...

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:32.150
We can't create something out of the ordinary.

00:49:32.350 --> 00:49:34.350
We'll restore all this in a moment.

00:49:34.350 --> 00:49:35.350
Yes, please!

00:49:36.760 --> 00:49:42.390
What do you think?

00:49:43.340 --> 00:49:45.970
Don't look at me so fixedly.

00:49:45.970 --> 00:49:48.490
That looks very good on you.

00:49:48.490 --> 00:49:51.460
Well, you don't have to say it out of obligation.

00:49:51.460 --> 00:49:54.460
I didn't know there was something like this at the institute.

00:49:54.460 --> 00:49:56.960
It's a secret bar for visits. Do you want something?

00:49:56.960 --> 00:49:58.530
No, thanks.

00:49:58.530 --> 00:49:59.440
Look at this.

00:50:04.540 --> 00:50:08.530
The Goragon. I have taken the data from Lisa's memory.

00:50:08.550 --> 00:50:13.030
The space is reduced to a single point around the Infinity.

00:50:13.080 --> 00:50:16.490
It is a definitive weapon with which to alter the entire universe.

00:50:16.510 --> 00:50:19.790
But if something like this gets started, our world is going to ...

00:50:19.810 --> 00:50:24.790
Why do you think Doctor Hell had planned to conquer the world?

00:50:24.810 --> 00:50:27.650
Well, I guess to do with him what pleases him.

00:50:27.670 --> 00:50:30.000
To do what? That's nothing more than a lie.

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:35.520
a nuisance, conquering the world can give power, wealth, fame. But he is not

00:50:35.520 --> 00:50:39.790
interested in any of that. Since the battle ended, I have been

00:50:39.790 --> 00:50:44.330
going around all that subject, until I came to a conclusion.

00:50:44.330 --> 00:50:50.860
Which one? Curiosity. Curiosity? What is humanity? The world? The

00:50:50.860 --> 00:50:56.380
universe? He wants to know everything about all that, and he is evaluating if this world

00:50:56.380 --> 00:51:00.000
is worthy of exist or not. So what if Doctor Hell

00:51:00.670 --> 00:51:02.670
Lose their interest in humans?

00:51:04.130 --> 00:51:05.130
Exactly.

00:51:05.130 --> 00:51:08.580
If everything seems to fit into their predictions,

00:51:08.580 --> 00:51:11.560
they won't hesitate to activate the Goragon.

00:51:11.560 --> 00:51:15.650
And then they'll be able to create a new world simply to observe it.

00:51:15.650 --> 00:51:22.720
They've been informed that a few hours ago,

00:51:22.720 --> 00:51:26.320
