00:51:26.320 --> 00:51:29.960
The world has become what it was and people are fighting each other again.

00:51:30.800 --> 00:51:35.950
For Doctor Hell, this would be the most boring and predictable scenario of all.

00:51:37.790 --> 00:51:41.590
We have to do something, now that we're still on time, or it will be too late.

00:51:42.610 --> 00:51:43.110
What do you mean?

00:51:44.300 --> 00:51:46.700
Save Tetsuya and destroy the Infinity.

00:51:47.050 --> 00:51:47.850
And will we win?

00:51:48.150 --> 00:51:50.250
Even if we lose, the result will be the same.

00:51:50.770 --> 00:51:51.670
Well, in that case...

00:51:51.670 --> 00:51:52.570
Do you know what Lisa says?

00:51:53.120 --> 00:51:58.420
She says that the second best option would be to enjoy happiness in the limited time we have left in this world.

00:51:59.260 --> 00:52:00.000
Happiness?

00:52:07.070 --> 00:52:19.300
I thought that by getting older I would understand things better, but at last I realized that it was not the second best option that I want, but the best.

00:52:20.450 --> 00:52:23.490
When this battle is over, we should talk.

00:52:23.490 --> 00:52:27.620
But saying something like that before going to fight is...

00:52:27.620 --> 00:52:28.640
Sayaka!

00:52:28.640 --> 00:52:30.000
Please!

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:32.440
- No. - Sayaka!

00:53:07.040 --> 00:53:09.030
Lieutenant Jun Hono, right?

00:53:09.030 --> 00:53:13.190
She is detained for using special weapons for particular purposes.

00:53:30.280 --> 00:53:33.780
I'll say that the old times were never better.

00:53:33.780 --> 00:53:40.650
