00:53:56.530 --> 00:54:00.000
But I couldn't. I didn't think...

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.860
I thought that the gut would bother me to be able to step on the pedals.

00:54:03.860 --> 00:54:11.590
Stupid, it has been your son who has prevented it.

00:54:11.590 --> 00:54:15.020
I fought to make this a better world.

00:54:15.020 --> 00:54:16.930
And surely in part I got it.

00:54:16.930 --> 00:54:21.360
I was mental about doing it because I am a soldier.

00:54:21.360 --> 00:54:25.360
However, I have not been able to take action and I feel useless.

00:54:25.360 --> 00:54:30.000
Calm down, you are not the only person who appreciates Tetsuo.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:39.890
That's it. He couldn't come, but we're going to save him. You'll see. Him and all of us.

